    {
        "content": "<p>fitzgen opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15051\">PR #15051</a> from <code>fitzgen:cm-gc-tuples-of-scalars</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The first bit of actually interacting with reference types in the CM+GC work. This forces us to build out a bunch of infrastructure, so I'm trying to keep this as minimal as possible by only supporting tuples of scalars. Follow up commits will introduce tuples of tuples and other reference-typed things like records and strings and arrays and all that.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 635817306,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1793219252
    },
