    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> fitzgen created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15051#discussion_r4417459977\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/WebAssembly/component-model/issues/525\">https://github.com/WebAssembly/component-model/issues/525</a></p>\n<p>I just removed the reference, since it will just become out of date once CM+GC is actually spec'd.</p>\n</blockquote>",
